    "updated_at": "2020-10-23T21:32:21Z",
    "body": "I've raised a PR for [ensuring we don't overwrite zle-keymap-select](https://github.com/starship/starship/pull/1826).\r\n\r\nFor your script, you can do one of two things -\r\n\r\n1. Since Starship will always append functions instead of overwriting (with this PR), you can source starship after your snippet above and it will work. However, this still leaves you at risk of overwriting functions if any script sourced above this snippet will still be overwritten.\r\n1. Similar to Starship, change your logic for defining ZLE widgets so that they don't overwrite priorly defined functions, similar to the PR I raised.\r\n\r\nHopefully, my PR will be merged soon and you'll be unblocked :)",
