    "body": "Hi there, I have the same issue as the OP, my config is a bit different but I also tried OP's config, both resulted in unable to get the block shaped cursor in `vicmd` mode. I'm on v0.51\r\nBelow is my config\r\n\r\n```\r\nfunction zle-keymap-select zle-line-init\r\n{\r\n       # change cursor shape in xterm\r\n       case $KEYMAP in\r\n               vicmd)      echo -e -n \"\\x1b[\\x32 q\";;  # block cursor\r\n               viins|main) echo -e -n \"\\x1b[\\x35 q\";;  # blinking line cursor\r\n       esac\r\n\r\n       zle reset-prompt\r\n       zle -R\r\n}\r\n\r\nzle -N zle-line-init\r\nzle -N zle-keymap-select\r\n\r\n```",
